{"id":"829c426641bc6abd","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-zfc-forcing3-support-iteration-stage.md","title":"ZFC Forcing3 Support Iteration Stage","display":"df-zfc-forcing3-support-iteration-stage — ZFC Forcing3 Support Iteration Stage","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing3-support-iteration-stage","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing3-support-iteration-stage"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing3-support-iteration-stage — ZFC Forcing3 Support Iteration Stage","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration-system]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing3-support-iteration-stage"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing3-support-iteration-stage</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing3-support-iteration-stage — ZFC Forcing3 Support Iteration Stage"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"39a84ca5e5beaeb5\" href=\"?note=39a84ca5e5beaeb5\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration-system\">58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\vec{\\mathbb Q},\\vec 1,\\delta,\\mathsf{Step},\\mathsf{Limit},\\alpha,p,S\\in V\">\\(\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\vec{\\mathbb Q},\\vec 1,\\delta,\\mathsf{Step},\\mathsf{Limit},\\alpha,p,S\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ForcingIterationSystem}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ForcingIterationSystem}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"39a84ca5e5beaeb5\" href=\"?note=39a84ca5e5beaeb5\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration-system\">58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration-system</a>) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3SupportIterationStage}_S\\subseteq V^9\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3SupportIterationStage}_S\\subseteq V^9\\)</span> (predicate defined here).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing3\\text{-}support\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}stage} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3SupportIterationStage}_S(\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\vec{\\mathbb Q},\\vec 1,\\delta,\\mathsf{Step},\\mathsf{Limit},\\alpha,p,S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ForcingIterationSystem}_S(\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\vec{\\mathbb Q},\\delta,\\mathsf{Step},\\mathsf{Limit})\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec 1,\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec 1))\\land\n\\alpha\\in\\delta\\cup\\{\\delta\\}\\land p\\in\\vec{\\mathbb P}(\\alpha)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(p,\\alpha,\\operatorname{ran}(p))\\land\nS=\\{\\xi\\in\\alpha:p(\\xi)\\neq\\vec 1(\\xi)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing3\\text{-}support\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}stage} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3SupportIterationStage}_S(\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\vec{\\mathbb Q},\\vec 1,\\delta,\\mathsf{Step},\\mathsf{Limit},\\alpha,p,S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ForcingIterationSystem}_S(\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\vec{\\mathbb Q},\\delta,\\mathsf{Step},\\mathsf{Limit})\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec 1,\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec 1))\\land\n\\alpha\\in\\delta\\cup\\{\\delta\\}\\land p\\in\\vec{\\mathbb P}(\\alpha)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(p,\\alpha,\\operatorname{ran}(p))\\land\nS=\\{\\xi\\in\\alpha:p(\\xi)\\neq\\vec 1(\\xi)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The successor-step relation and limit-support relation are explicit parameters inherited from the five-place iteration-system predicate.</li>\n<li>The default-condition family and each stage condition are set-coded functions; the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> is not used as a function codomain.</li>\n<li>The stage parameter may equal the iteration length, so the support of a terminal condition is also covered.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration-system","status":"resolved","id":"39a84ca5e5beaeb5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration-system","status":"resolved","id":"39a84ca5e5beaeb5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ForcingIterationSystem}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (see [[58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration-system]]) and $\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[58-df-function]]).","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ForcingIterationSystem}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (see [[58-df-zfc-forcing-iteration-system]]) and $\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[58-df-function]]).","embed":false}],"math":